THIRD-PARTY DATA

mondegreen/data/kanji_readings.json and mondegreen/data/common_kanji.json contain
Japanese character readings derived from UniDic (via fugashi / unidic-lite) and
pykakasi. UniDic is distributed by the National Institute for Japanese Language
and Linguistics under a tri-licence (GPL 2.0 / LGPL 2.1 / BSD 3-clause); these
files are used under the BSD 3-clause option, with attribution.
  UniDic:    https://clrd.ninjal.ac.jp/unidic/
  pykakasi:  GPL-3.0 (used only at build time to generate the table, not linked)

All personal names, product names and organisation names in the generated
glossaries and corpora are synthetic, produced by
mondegreen.harvest.GlossaryBuilder. Any resemblance to a real person or company
is coincidental.
